      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "[Based on this](https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1222-keyboard-does-not-load-read-only-inputfield-text), it almost seems if they got their wires crossed and made Read-Only input fields *write only*.\nFrom my understanding of Unity, the VRChat keyboard is a custom solution that writes to the Text component, rather than sending actual key input, so they are not limited by Read Only themselves; it's up to them to read the property and adjust accordingly.\nCurrent behavior prevents read but allows write, lmao.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
