  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When using a input field with ReadOnly checked, the input keyboard doesn't respect that and overwrites the text.\n**Expected Behaviour**\nReadOnly text will stay and keyboard won't update it (maybe a notification/error message)\n**Current Behaviour**\nEntering text from the input keyboard will override the text on a readonly field.\n**Steps to reproduce**\n1. Set up a Input Field with ReadOnly checked\n2. Upload and go to that world\n3. Click the input field and type your text\n4. See text being overwritten with the keyboard input.",
